From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 23:38:30 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: admit the J604 to the retained T8132 MTP session

The MacBook Pro (14-inch, M4, 2024) has the same MTP input coprocessor
as the J713: Apple's j604ap and j713ap device trees (25G83, 26B123) give
both the same iop,ascwrap-v6 ASC at 0x394600000 with an rtbuddy-v2 nub,
the same t8110 dart-mtp at 0x394800000 and the same dockchannel-mtp, and
the trackpad AFE and STM resets on SMC gP1c/gP1d.

Accept apple,j604 at the two machine gates that keep a running
mtp-live-v1 session: the rtkit-helper session preservation and the
retained MTP DART bypass. The J713-only legacy marker path, the radio
and display DART retention and the PCI identity default stay J713-only.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c       | 3 ++-
 drivers/soc/apple/rtkit-helper.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
index 5be11d6e56..c368a82992 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
@@ -3246,7 +3246,8 @@ params_done:
 	dart->fw_mirror = dart->locked && !dart->fw_handoff &&
 		(of_device_is_compatible(dev->of_node, "apple,t8140-dart") ||
 		 of_device_is_compatible(dev->of_node, "apple,t8142-dart"));
-	if (of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j713") &&
+	if ((of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j713") ||
+	     of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j604")) &&
 	    of_machine_is_compatible("apple,t8132") &&
 	    res->start == 0x394800000ULL && dart->hw->type == DART_T8110 &&
 	    !dart->locked && !tunneled && dart->supports_bypass &&
diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit-helper.c b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit-helper.c
index 6d958bfb00..a074dd4a63 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit-helper.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit-helper.c
@@ -273,7 +273,8 @@ static int apple_rtkit_helper_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 		count = apple_rtkit_helper_inherit_buffers(helper, buffers);
 		if (count < 0)
 			return dev_err_probe(dev, count, "Invalid inherited RTKit buffers\n");
-		if (of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j713") &&
+		if ((of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j713") ||
+		     of_machine_is_compatible("apple,j604")) &&
 		    of_device_is_compatible(dev->of_node, "apple,t8132-mtp"))
 			helper->preserved = true;
 	}
